  "title": "I'm at Starbucks",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-08-30",
  "synopsis": "Ben and Lili lose sight of each other when they’re out shopping.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/511/d457a1e67591454089a594426aec0af8a8426cf0.mp3?1589791658",
  "series": {
