      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：喂，本，你在哪儿呢？我就看了看衣服，你怎么就不见了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：喂，本，你在哪兒呢？我就看了看衣服，你怎麼就不見了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wéi běn nǐ zài nǎ'r ne wǒ jiù kàn le kàn yī fu nǐ zěn me jiù bú jiàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Hello. Ben, where are you? I was just looking at clothes, how come you suddenly disappeared?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：你已经看了两个小时了！",
      "traditional": "本：你已經看了兩個小時了！",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ yǐ jīng kàn le liǎng ge xiǎo shí le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: You’ve already been looking for two hours!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：呵呵！不好意思啊！你现在在哪儿呢？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：呵呵！不好意思啊！你現在在哪兒呢？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hē hē bù hǎo yì si a nǐ xiàn zài zài nǎ'r ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Hehe! Sorry! Where are you now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：我在星巴克。",
      "traditional": "本：我在星巴克。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ zài xīng bā kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I’m at Starbucks."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哪个星巴克？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哪個星巴克？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì něi ge xīng bā kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Which Starbucks?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：就是北京饭店旁边的那个星巴克。",
      "traditional": "本：就是北京飯店旁邊的那個星巴克。",
      "pinyin": "běn jiù shì běi jīng fàn diàn páng biān de nèi ge xīng bā kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: The Starbucks next to the Beijing Hotel."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好的，你等着，我去找你。拜拜！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好的，你等著，我去找你。拜拜！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo de nǐ děng zhe wǒ qù zhǎo nǐ bái bái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ok. Wait there and I’ll go look for you. Bye bye!"
    },
